WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.709 --> 00:00:05.835
I am Mahsa.

00:00:06.294 --> 00:00:08.213
I am 22 years old.

00:00:08.588 --> 00:00:10.173
I am from Kurdistan.

00:00:11.258 --> 00:00:14.844
I came on vacation to Tehran
for two days with my brother.

00:00:15.595 --> 00:00:18.932
I got arrested for not wearing
my veil properly.

00:00:19.266 --> 00:00:21.268
Then I was beaten repeatedly

00:00:21.268 --> 00:00:24.312
and eventually went into a coma and died.

00:00:25.689 --> 00:00:26.982
I am Nika.

00:00:27.023 --> 00:00:28.358
I'm 16 years old.

00:00:29.568 --> 00:00:32.988
I dressed all in black,
took my water bottle

00:00:32.988 --> 00:00:36.616
and a small towel
to protect myself from tear gas.

00:00:37.075 --> 00:00:39.244
I went on the street to protest.

00:00:39.619 --> 00:00:41.580
I got kidnapped, tortured.

00:00:43.832 --> 00:00:46.001
I'm Nika's shattered skull.

00:00:46.626 --> 00:00:48.628
I am her battered body,

00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:52.173
delivered to her family
10 days after she got kidnapped.

00:00:52.882 --> 00:00:56.052
Eventually, she was buried without warning

00:00:56.094 --> 00:00:57.762
in some faraway cemetery.

00:00:59.889 --> 00:01:01.308
I am Pouya.

00:01:01.349 --> 00:01:03.810
I went to protest with my mother.

00:01:03.852 --> 00:01:06.813
She said, "Don't let go of my hand."

00:01:07.522 --> 00:01:08.732
But I did.

00:01:09.065 --> 00:01:10.275
And I got shot.

00:01:10.942 --> 00:01:12.819
I died in front of her eyes.

00:01:14.279 --> 00:01:15.447
I'm Kian.

00:01:15.780 --> 00:01:17.741
I'm only ten years old.

00:01:18.408 --> 00:01:20.452
I wanted to become a scientist.

00:01:21.119 --> 00:01:23.330
But my body was riddled with bullets.

00:01:24.247 --> 00:01:28.043
I am the boat on wheels he made
with his little hands,

00:01:28.043 --> 00:01:31.338
carrying 70 more children
over the rainbow,

00:01:31.379 --> 00:01:32.797
killed in a similar way.

00:01:34.382 --> 00:01:38.470
I am Kian's father who was shot
and paralyzed for life.

00:01:39.888 --> 00:01:42.474
I am Mohammad Mehdi, the Karate Boy.

00:01:43.850 --> 00:01:47.228
I am the son of a peddler
brought up in poverty.

00:01:48.396 --> 00:01:51.524
I was hanged at dawn
during the morning prayers.

00:01:53.401 --> 00:01:57.113
I am one of the last sentences
of Mohammad to his father.

00:01:58.657 --> 00:02:01.159
"Don't tell mom they want to execute me."

00:02:02.744 --> 00:02:04.913
I am Toomaj, a rapper.

00:02:05.205 --> 00:02:09.501
Tortured and kept in solitary confinement
for months and months.

00:02:11.461 --> 00:02:13.922
I am Elaheh, I am Niloofar.

00:02:14.464 --> 00:02:17.801
We are journalists who reported
on the death of Mahsa.

00:02:18.635 --> 00:02:20.387
We have been in prison since.

00:02:22.138 --> 00:02:26.309
I am 537 victims
of this revolution in Iran.

00:02:27.143 --> 00:02:29.145
The ones who got executed.

00:02:29.145 --> 00:02:30.980
The ones who got tortured.

00:02:30.980 --> 00:02:35.026
The tens of thousands of wounded
and arrested and imprisoned,

00:02:35.068 --> 00:02:36.695
innocent men and women.

00:02:38.321 --> 00:02:40.990
I am the raised fist of young girls

00:02:41.032 --> 00:02:43.660
with their hair flowing in the wind.

00:02:43.702 --> 00:02:45.370
I am their glorious dance.

00:02:45.704 --> 00:02:49.165
I am their blood,
their sighs, their tears,

00:02:49.207 --> 00:02:52.669
their dreams, their eyes,

00:02:52.711 --> 00:02:55.672
their lost eyes by rubber bullets.

00:02:56.923 --> 00:02:58.925
I am the reason they stood up.

00:02:59.384 --> 00:03:00.927
I am freedom.

00:03:02.470 --> 00:03:05.890
And I'm also Golshifteh.

00:03:06.349 --> 00:03:07.517
I'm an artist.

00:03:07.976 --> 00:03:11.438
I'm living a life of exile
for the past 15 years.

00:03:12.439 --> 00:03:14.357
I was forced to leave my motherland.

00:03:15.275 --> 00:03:20.363
But I kept fighting,
as a woman, for life, to be free.

00:03:21.781 --> 00:03:26.244
My choices and existence
as an exiled female artist

00:03:26.286 --> 00:03:27.454
was my battle.

00:03:27.954 --> 00:03:29.789
Exist to resist.

00:03:31.666 --> 00:03:34.711
But the courageous, fearless Generation Z,

00:03:34.753 --> 00:03:36.713
who started this revolution,

00:03:36.713 --> 00:03:38.047
they didn't leave.

00:03:38.047 --> 00:03:39.257
They stayed.

00:03:39.299 --> 00:03:44.095
And they went on the street and died
for woman, life and freedom.

00:03:45.805 --> 00:03:48.850
Death breaks the cage

00:03:48.850 --> 00:03:51.936
but doesn't kill the bird, as Rumi says.

00:03:53.104 --> 00:03:55.482
We carry these birds in us,

00:03:55.482 --> 00:03:58.109
let them fly on their way to victory.

00:03:59.027 --> 00:04:04.157
Wars, discrimination,
dictatorships, racism,

00:04:04.157 --> 00:04:05.700
it is all the same.

00:04:05.992 --> 00:04:08.286
Iran is the rest of the world.

00:04:08.328 --> 00:04:09.788
The world is Iran.

00:04:10.622 --> 00:04:12.290
Woman, Life, Freedom;

00:04:12.332 --> 00:04:13.917
Black Lives Matter;

00:04:13.958 --> 00:04:15.502
Glory to Ukraine.

00:04:16.961 --> 00:04:19.756
Ignorance and fear is the cause of it all.

00:04:21.466 --> 00:04:27.013
We can all decide today to be the bridge
to unite rather than separate.

00:04:27.931 --> 00:04:30.683
Any child living in a dictatorship,

00:04:30.683 --> 00:04:33.603
any refugee child being denied help,

00:04:33.603 --> 00:04:36.481
any child being killed in war,

00:04:36.523 --> 00:04:40.527
if we ignore one,
we ignore our own children

00:04:40.527 --> 00:04:42.237
and we deny humanity.

00:04:43.196 --> 00:04:45.824
The poet Saadi once said,

00:04:45.865 --> 00:04:48.701
"Human beings are members of a whole.

00:04:49.285 --> 00:04:52.163
In creation of one essence and soul.

00:04:52.789 --> 00:04:56.334
If one member is afflicted with pain,

00:04:56.334 --> 00:04:59.212
other members uneasy will remain.

00:05:00.088 --> 00:05:03.550
If you have no sympathy for human pain,

00:05:03.591 --> 00:05:06.845
the name of human you cannot retain."

00:05:07.929 --> 00:05:09.055
Thank you.

